ed</a> Condition.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Oily_Sup\">Sources of Oily Sup</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cup_of_Oil\" title=\"Cup of Oil\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Cup_of_Oil_Item_Icon.png/30px-Cup_of_Oil_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Cup_of_Oil_Item_Icon.png/45px-Cup_of_Oil_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Cup_of_Oil_Item_Icon.png/60px-Cup_of_Oil_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Cup_of_Oil_Item_Icon.png/30px-Cup_of_Oil_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Cup_of_Oil_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cup_of_Oil\" title=\"Cup of Oil\">Cup of Oil</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>DRINK</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Alcohol\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/4